        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa goobalool buuneeda aba ng'eanyiida Shekemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwada geat Yoshuwa eemeeda fuga Israeli sean aba Shekemu, ak gaguursa gweargwa, ea fuga ambaliischi ea fuga aheeldooschi buuneeda, ea fuga hees bea Israeli; ak geapka madeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa fuga sean, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, ‘Ghweanigeagwa ghayi garayi goobiida giigheawda Eenda Furati, ghweanda Abrahamu was Dera, ea Nahori; abeeda gagadiiyeesa aseecheeka suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geageandi ghweandeang'wa was Abrahamu aba giigheawda Eenda Furati ak ghaadoabiiwji aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani, nea ghaanung' gwaheedu jeataanyi. Ak ghaadawji niny Isaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghaadawji Isaka Yakobo ea Esawu. Ak ghaadawji Esawu ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Seyiri goombal, nea Yakobo ea diibigaaschi ghwararang'aada gaweay Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geajeakti Musa ea Haruni, ak ghaalaschi ng'eanyiida Misri aba gideasinyi aba bugusta nyaawa; amang'ata gearuunaneegwa jeedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gearuuni ghweanigeagwa Misri, ak ghoahiti ghuuta basooda; ak gwadagu geeshta ghweanigeagwa fuga Misri sea mutukwajeega ea fuga faraasajeega, ea ghwahita basooda Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gooyeawusa NG'UTAMIIDA, hean ghwayiin misaneeda dageascheedeang'wa ea dea fuga Misri, ak ghwanung' ghwahidu basooda badayda nyaawa ea gwadukuta saawa; ak ghwadaah gheanyangeagwa gideahindi fuga Misri; ak goopiidi jeeda dareapcheeda ea gageawiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayeaneegwa ng'eanyiida fuga Amori mida giigheawda Yordani; ak goong'ucheewi, ak ghayiinyi saawa geatingeagwa, ak goombali ng'eanyiida nyaawa, nea ghaanung' goosha saawa aba madeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Balaki was orjeeda Sipori, was sugoocheanda Moabu, ak gang'uchi sea fuga Israeli; ak goojeakta buuneeda eeguursa Balaamu was orjeeda Beori ghwahidu ghamwaashtaneegwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mealeeysiina iit Balaamu; hean gagooneegwa ghawooda; ak ghaghuuhaneegwa geatindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoakghaawi Yordani ak ghoahiti Yeriko hean goong'ucheewi fuga Yeriko, eara Amori, ea Beresi, ea Ganaani, ea Hiti, ea Girgashi, ea Hafiti, ea Yebusi, ak ghaayiinyi saawa geatingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geajeagu gheareamnyeanda madeedeang'wa, ak ghahoan saawa aba madeedeang'wa, sugoodi iyeenya bea fuga Amori; ak ea mwahoanana ng'utaang'u ghana ghuweang'daang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea neagoonyeegwa ng'eanyiida mii agadiyeesiina ea mujiinajeega miyaadeasa, ak goopiidi jeeni; nea ghoayaaji haghweega sabiibajeega ea saytuunajeega mii ang'aapta.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi biissa asisiina mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak googadiyeesi niny aba huumeanda ea doobiiwnata; oang'aamwana heedeang'wa aseecheeka ghayi gadiyeesa ghweanigeagwa aba giigheawda eenda Furati, ea aba ng'eanyiida Misri, agadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iyoadaayi gideaba mwadoabiiwa gadiyeesiinda NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda ghoaloachi askweareani dea jea agadiyeesiina, ii aseecheeka ghayi gadiyeesa ghweanigeagwa aba ng'eanyiida giigheawda eenda Furati, ghana aseecheeka Amori oopiidi ng'eanyiida nyaawa; ak aniini ea gheanyu, gajeegadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha buuneeda ak geeyeesha, “Manda adeenung'usi heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geegadiyeesi aseecheeka suuk; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA ghayi aruunaneasa sea ghweanigaasa ng'eanyiida Misri, aba gheeda soomjeandumeeda, ea dea ghayi sin gwadeagwajeega hees aba madeedeanya, ak ghoahaaghwaneasa aba naweedida sean siyaachiin, ea bugusta fuga sean sisikchi bugusta nyaawaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooruuta NG'UTAMIIDA fuga sean aba madeedeanya was fuga Amori mida ng'eanyiini; ak ghamneawa gajeegadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba ASEETEANYA gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Yoshuwa ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Majagadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA; aba gideaba niny ASEETA ghaydit gil; ak ea ASEETA lachaghuut haleanjeeda; ak ea maygwasamsa giidiinyeanyeekeagwa ghana riing'eegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas goonung'usi heeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak googadiyeesi aseecheeka rabasta, abeeda gaygwayamu geaw ak gwasimaneegwa gidamuy, ak gayghwanung' ooshealana, nea nisineegwa gidamiy.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha buuneeda Yoshuwa, “Manda; gajeegadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yoshuwa buuneeda, “Agooga noowooschi mushoodiga aba gurooruunatkeagwa aba gideaba noaloachi NG'UTAMIIDA, ak googadiyeesi niny.” Geeyeesha, “Aseasa geawooschi mushoodiga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Asi oang'aamwana bugusteang'wa aseecheeka rabasta, ak goofuursi gurooruunatkeagwa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda buuneeda ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa, “Gajeegadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA ak gajeeleeysiina iit ghuutaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Yoshuwa neajeeda sea buuneeda askweardida, ak gwasin digheanyeeka ea deaweeda aba badahuuka nyaawa aba Shekemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gang'oorsa Yoshuwa ng'asheesu jeeda gitaabooda deaweedeeda ASEETA; ak gageanu lagheaneeda haw; ak ghamiinda aba hoowa aba geeshta sabiida neekeewa heeda ghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa buuneesean, “Ng'ula, lagheaneeni gayghoah muushoocheanda aba heedeanya; aba gideaba lagheaneeni niyiiy ng'asheega sean abaloolaneasa NG'UTAMIIDA; asi gayghoah muushoocheanda aba badahuukeagwa gideaba adoonung'usi heeda ASEETEANG'WA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasiksa Yoshuwa buuneeda gaweay gaba nih weah heechea goobiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
