              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geakiga ghayi bea Yosefu eana fuga Israeli Misrihiin, geebung'sa ng'eanyiida Shekemu, heeda ng'eanyiida ghayi shaah Yakobo aba heeda orjooga Amori was ghweanda Shekemu aba lapiyaji bughala ghoah ng'eanyiida jea gwahearan jeacheenga Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
