        {
          "text": "Ak ghami Eliyasari was orjeeda Haruni; ak geebung'sa niny Gibeya, was mujiineeda Finehasi was orjeedaanyi, ghayi siitaw niny mida ng'eanyiida heayeeniga Efraimu.",
